/20240910/910143669879836672675203.png/Fmx3RuHUiu4VnxbYpvwDmGVn-G-1Fr32AkOSjgJDko4\"/><figcaption>章子怡（微博@章子怡）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"章子怡（微博@章子怡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240910/910143667241488384365081.png/PfiCwvaxbDl4A0miPReuxVZl5G6KNUYiRd5arUXeWq0\"/><figcaption>章子怡（微博@章子怡）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"章子怡（微博@章子怡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240910/910143664477442048798546.jpeg/pkDMTjsU-cOEWerMieprySMOQTiFJGM-eQTBt3kEwbc\"/><figcaption>章子怡（微博@章子怡）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"章子怡出演女主角。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240313/844575367711690752391065.jpeg/Pd87wWDCw1T0DFKXjTJ6P7peH3fK7z9xlbDjnJWw45w\"/><figcaption>章子怡出演女主角。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"章子怡（微博@章子怡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231024/793464138122661888740196.jpeg/wCD03EOIwF0CbFfDUBWSVid1_4nbOigDMDnMMjA5zDI\"/><figcaption>章子怡（微博@章子怡）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"章子怡（微博@章子怡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231024/793464135601623040107924.jpeg/ME3uN758mLqgmDgRfhh5xbEoWK4w8kzZbs6Svm7Okr4\"/><figcaption>章子怡（微博@章子怡）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"章子怡（微博@章子怡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231024/793464141612453888782593.jpeg/qaA0rtlwg_44HpgaYWmUrTUCgIHT13O1f-YS4n_mEuI\"/><figcaption>章子怡（微博@章子怡）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"章子怡（微博@章子怡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231024/793464133344956416152934.jpeg/lfurqHL6I_mGwm6LHcBHT80DHt_roAURaCqeZGgqnmQ\"/><figcaption>章子怡（微博@章子怡）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲《聯合早報》授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:18:17.890361+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2165,"images":34,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T09:00:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T11:13:43.469947+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:12:13.073573+00:00","content_hash":"bf8dcc1